<title>USA: Anesta names Thomas King as president.</title>
<headline>Anesta names Thomas King as president.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anesta Corp said on Thursday it had elected Thomas King as president of the company.</p>
<p>It said King would still keep his post as chief operating officer and a director of the company.</p>
<p>Former President William Moeller will remain as chief executive officer and a member of the board of directors, it said.</p>
<p>Anesta specializes in oral transmucosal drug delivery.</p>
</text>
